{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】荃灣大壩街清晨有地下鹹水管爆裂。</p>\n<p>現場是大壩街23號對開。清晨5時左右，行人路一條地下鹹水管爆裂，磚塊被水沖起，路面滿佈沙石，水務署派員關上水掣搶修。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:04:14.312704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:41:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T23:57:45.407512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:57:45.407512+00:00","content_hash":"264b6b62fe1f1294f813d9f56c8ee7760a32b787774b90f2dc9c82cff4f89a3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}